WEBVTT

00:11.968 --> 00:18.016
♪Listen to the cicadas in the midsummer♪

00:18.944 --> 00:21.653
♪The reflection in your eyes♪

00:22.498 --> 00:27.040
♪A brilliant scenery♪

00:27.744 --> 00:33.518
♪Moonlight spills over
the endless clear sky♪

00:34.349 --> 00:42.496
♪The roar of the heartbeat
leaves a trace behind♪

00:44.032 --> 00:49.566
♪Crush, when night meets dawn♪

00:51.616 --> 00:57.786
♪Crush, rushing to you in the crowd♪

00:59.520 --> 01:02.624
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

01:03.040 --> 01:07.085
♪Fervent, boiling love♪

01:07.776 --> 01:11.760
♪How you long for the future♪

01:12.128 --> 01:15.328
♪Charging recklessly, getting hurt♪

01:15.520 --> 01:18.475
♪Fall in my heart♪

01:18.475 --> 01:22.816
♪If tears fill your eyes♪

01:23.328 --> 01:27.297
♪Let the damp wind stay in memories♪

01:27.566 --> 01:33.940
♪We stand by each other among the crowd♪

01:33.940 --> 01:39.040
=Be Passionately in Love=

01:40.568 --> 01:47.064
=Episode 16=
(I'm Trying to Win My Ex Back)

01:48.203 --> 01:49.243
You have no idea

01:49.603 --> 01:50.722
what happened

01:50.722 --> 01:51.723
in the first month.

01:52.163 --> 01:53.083
A senior

01:53.163 --> 01:54.403
brings Xu Zhi breakfast

01:54.403 --> 01:56.484
at 8 AM outside her dorm every day.

01:56.683 --> 01:58.083
Guess what Xu Zhi said to him.

01:58.404 --> 01:59.404
What did she say?

02:00.203 --> 02:01.203
She said,

02:01.364 --> 02:03.242
"Senior, you're a bit too late.

02:03.242 --> 02:04.243
I've already eaten."

02:04.364 --> 02:05.722
The guy asked her, "What time

02:05.722 --> 02:06.723
do you have breakfast?"

02:07.764 --> 02:09.004
She said, "At 4 AM."

02:09.603 --> 02:11.924
The senior complained to his roommate,

02:12.043 --> 02:14.004
"She's so mean.

02:14.123 --> 02:15.283
She could have said 6 AM

02:15.283 --> 02:17.484
to make it sound less harsh."

02:17.484 --> 02:19.364
Who wakes up at 4 AM in college?

02:19.723 --> 02:20.804
She does.

02:23.083 --> 02:24.083
How do you know?

02:24.924 --> 02:26.284
You think it's easy to succeed?

02:26.964 --> 02:28.884
As the only dark horse in Ruijun School,

02:29.083 --> 02:30.964
she has put in great effort to get here.

02:31.163 --> 02:32.284
That's impressive.

02:33.123 --> 02:33.845
We studied so hard

02:33.845 --> 02:35.484
in the No.1 High School.

02:35.683 --> 02:38.123
We benefited
from the environment greatly.

02:38.243 --> 02:40.123
It's expected that we can get enrolled.

02:40.723 --> 02:41.723
But she's different.

02:42.444 --> 02:44.324
Her story brought hope to many people.

02:45.004 --> 02:46.284
Don't you find it cool?

02:47.964 --> 02:48.964
True.

02:49.203 --> 02:50.324
She's much cooler than us.

03:08.804 --> 03:10.083
She has a lot of admirers?

03:12.804 --> 03:13.844
Anyway,

03:14.203 --> 03:15.284
there are quite a few.

03:15.683 --> 03:17.884
I've run into several of them.

03:18.123 --> 03:20.123
Random people asked for her contact.

03:23.083 --> 03:24.444
But it's died down a lot.

03:24.643 --> 03:26.324
They know that she's hard to approach.

03:26.603 --> 03:28.163
Even Jiang Yu couldn't win her over.

03:28.723 --> 03:31.122
So others wouldn't humiliate themselves.

03:31.122 --> 03:32.123
Jiang Yu?

03:32.484 --> 03:33.603
The one we just ran into?

03:37.324 --> 03:38.324
He's alright.

03:38.683 --> 03:39.683
Pretty handsome.

03:41.083 --> 03:43.284
Come on, stop being so jealous.

03:43.404 --> 03:44.404
I'm not jealous.

03:45.912 --> 03:47.004
If she wants to date

03:47.004 --> 03:48.123
a decent guy,

03:49.004 --> 03:50.004
I'm fine with it.

03:55.764 --> 03:56.764
Sure.

03:57.004 --> 03:58.284
Anyway, I've asked around.

03:58.764 --> 03:59.844
Jiang Yu

03:59.964 --> 04:01.563
is quite a nice guy.

04:02.083 --> 04:03.123
Xu Zhi

04:03.243 --> 04:05.484
works in his department.

04:06.404 --> 04:07.404
What department?

04:09.123 --> 04:10.203
I heard

04:10.364 --> 04:11.444
that a senior student

04:12.284 --> 04:13.964
sharing the dorm with Xu Zhi

04:15.083 --> 04:16.683
instigated Xu Zhi to join

04:16.844 --> 04:18.523
the publicity department.

04:19.004 --> 04:20.884
Anyway, he has the upper hand here.

04:21.603 --> 04:22.603
Bro,

04:22.723 --> 04:23.804
you'd better hurry.

04:29.643 --> 04:31.843
It can accommodate about 500 people.

04:31.843 --> 04:33.404
I think the venue is big enough.

04:33.563 --> 04:35.444
(Campus Basketball Game)
Since we have so many audiences,

04:35.603 --> 04:37.242
we must secure a drink supplier

04:37.242 --> 04:38.364
as soon as possible.

04:38.484 --> 04:40.404
So how's it going

04:40.484 --> 04:42.444
with the two potential sponsors?

04:43.324 --> 04:44.843
I have their information.

04:44.843 --> 04:45.884
I'll send it to everyone.

04:46.004 --> 04:47.324
We'll decide

04:47.324 --> 04:49.444
whom to work with through discussion.

04:52.123 --> 04:54.563
That's pretty much it
about the sponsorship

04:54.764 --> 04:56.324
for next week's basketball game.

04:56.563 --> 04:57.643
Let's see which one

04:57.643 --> 04:58.563
of these two companies

04:58.563 --> 04:59.643
should we work with.

04:59.924 --> 05:00.484
Alright?

05:00.484 --> 05:01.484
- Keep it up.
- Okay.

05:01.683 --> 05:02.683
- Alright.
- Okay.

05:04.243 --> 05:05.243
Senior,

05:05.484 --> 05:07.324
we have many potential sponsors.

05:07.563 --> 05:08.763
How do we decide

05:08.763 --> 05:10.682
which one is better?

05:10.682 --> 05:12.203
Should we work with all of them

05:12.324 --> 05:14.243
or should we choose one?

05:15.643 --> 05:17.004
It requires more consideration.

05:17.444 --> 05:18.004
Alright.

05:18.404 --> 05:19.603
Let's see.

05:20.004 --> 05:22.043
Which one should we choose?

05:22.484 --> 05:23.484
Which one

05:23.683 --> 05:24.884
do you think is better?

05:25.284 --> 05:27.288
Focus on how much the school can fund.

05:27.288 --> 05:29.764
(Something bothering you?
Feeling unwell?)

05:38.563 --> 05:39.683
That's it then.

05:40.243 --> 05:41.243
(Go back to rest.)

05:41.764 --> 05:43.203
(I'll update you later.)

05:44.163 --> 05:45.284
- Okay, no problem.
- Okay.

05:45.484 --> 05:46.683
Send me a copy too.

05:47.804 --> 05:48.563
Let's pack up.

05:48.563 --> 05:49.563
- Alright.
- Okay.

05:49.924 --> 05:50.964
(Thank you, Senior.)

05:51.284 --> 05:51.884
Alright.

05:52.284 --> 05:53.444
Take a look at this.

05:54.072 --> 05:55.044
Let's put these away

05:55.044 --> 05:56.964
and start working on it.

05:57.523 --> 05:58.523
Okay.

05:58.603 --> 05:59.364
- Alright.
- Okay.

05:59.364 --> 06:00.364
Alright.

06:04.804 --> 06:06.682
Zhi, stop being mad.

06:06.682 --> 06:08.444
Chen Luzhou is not that kind of person.

06:08.723 --> 06:09.723
What kind of person?

06:10.043 --> 06:12.562
The kind who comes and goes
as they please

06:12.562 --> 06:13.643
and shirks responsibility.

06:13.804 --> 06:14.844
You know him well?

06:15.484 --> 06:16.484
No, I don't.

06:16.884 --> 06:19.443
I just think that he didn't tell you

06:19.443 --> 06:21.643
because he couldn't.

06:24.123 --> 06:25.444
You're not surprised

06:27.043 --> 06:28.163
that Chen Luzhou came

06:28.163 --> 06:29.603
to Huaguang University.

06:30.643 --> 06:31.643
Come clean.

06:37.643 --> 06:39.003
I went to Zhu Yangqi's place

06:39.003 --> 06:40.364
when I first came to Beijing

06:40.364 --> 06:41.285
to form a plan

06:41.285 --> 06:42.484
to surprise you.

06:42.683 --> 06:44.043
But in his rental, I ran into

06:44.243 --> 06:45.963
Chen Luzhou who had just returned.

06:45.963 --> 06:47.284
Turns out I was the only fool.

06:47.284 --> 06:48.803
I didn't mean to hide it from you.

06:48.803 --> 06:50.404
They forbade me from telling you.

06:50.404 --> 06:51.683
Enough, no need to explain.

06:52.243 --> 06:53.523
Are you really mad at me?

06:53.603 --> 06:55.723
We're breaking off for 24 hours.

06:56.043 --> 06:57.123
Where are you going?

06:57.123 --> 06:57.844
Back to study

06:57.924 --> 06:58.924
to feel better.

07:03.844 --> 07:05.964
Is this the mindset of a top student?

07:13.563 --> 07:14.764
We're finally back.

07:15.723 --> 07:16.723
Xu Zhi.

07:17.163 --> 07:18.163
How did it go?

07:18.163 --> 07:19.203
Did you see that guy?

07:20.523 --> 07:21.884
Isn't he extremely

07:22.123 --> 07:23.203
handsome?

07:24.163 --> 07:25.884
He's okay. Just so-so.

07:26.364 --> 07:27.963
Are you calling the grapes sour

07:27.963 --> 07:28.964
out of jealousy?

07:29.284 --> 07:30.643
This is good.

07:31.243 --> 07:32.924
You have different aesthetics.

07:33.163 --> 07:34.163
Besides,

07:35.844 --> 07:37.484
I really find Jiang Yu nice

07:37.804 --> 07:38.804
and trustworthy.

07:39.324 --> 07:40.523
Give him a chance, maybe.

07:40.924 --> 07:42.284
Come on. Can't you tell

07:42.284 --> 07:44.243
that Xu Zhi doesn't like him at all?

07:44.844 --> 07:45.805
She said she wasn't

07:45.805 --> 07:47.082
looking for a relationship.

07:47.082 --> 07:48.444
Why do you keep pushing her?

07:48.444 --> 07:50.964
I just don't want her
to miss out on him.

07:51.364 --> 07:52.643
Besides, look at her.

07:52.764 --> 07:53.884
Isn't it obvious

07:54.284 --> 07:55.562
that she hasn't

07:55.562 --> 07:57.804
moved on from the last relationship?

07:58.563 --> 07:59.723
Jiang Yu is a nice guy.

07:59.884 --> 08:00.764
Don't you think so?

08:00.764 --> 08:01.364
That's true.

08:01.523 --> 08:02.523
No, I don't.

08:02.523 --> 08:03.924
That's very kind of you.

08:03.924 --> 08:06.043
But I don't have feelings for him.

08:07.964 --> 08:08.603
Enough.

08:08.924 --> 08:10.284
We're roommates.

08:10.523 --> 08:12.364
Don't be so serious. Okay?

08:13.723 --> 08:14.723
Fine.

08:14.804 --> 08:15.844
I won't mention it again.

08:18.403 --> 08:19.043
It's okay.

08:19.203 --> 08:20.203
I apologize.

08:20.323 --> 08:21.964
I got worked up just now.

08:22.403 --> 08:23.123
Sorry.

08:23.243 --> 08:24.403
What's wrong, Si?

08:24.764 --> 08:26.524
Anything bothering you lately?

08:27.043 --> 08:28.804
My boyfriend annoys me so much.

08:28.884 --> 08:29.884
Your boyfriend?

08:30.083 --> 08:31.123
Since when?

08:32.684 --> 08:34.644
We started dating before university

08:34.884 --> 08:36.644
and we both got admitted here.

08:37.004 --> 08:38.564
Nice, Si.

08:38.804 --> 08:40.243
You're quite something.

08:40.243 --> 08:40.844
Tell us.

08:40.924 --> 08:42.524
What does he study? What's his name?

08:42.524 --> 08:43.243
Got a photo?

08:43.483 --> 08:44.483
Economics.

08:44.564 --> 08:45.564
Zhao Tianqi.

08:46.123 --> 08:47.924
Economics. Zhao Tianqi.

08:48.083 --> 08:49.203
- Haven't heard of him.
- Haven't heard of him.

08:50.684 --> 08:51.684
Come on.

08:51.804 --> 08:52.844
He's very handsome.

08:52.964 --> 08:54.323
He's also been to the canteen.

08:54.524 --> 08:55.323
Really?

08:55.403 --> 08:55.924
Yeah.

08:55.924 --> 08:57.724
Introduce him to us next time.

08:58.203 --> 08:59.764
That depends on my mood.

08:59.764 --> 09:01.403
I'll see if he's
as handsome as Jiang Yu.

09:03.483 --> 09:04.524
Wait, Si.

09:04.964 --> 09:06.163
Why are you mad

09:06.323 --> 09:07.443
at your boyfriend?

09:12.564 --> 09:13.684
I'm not forcing you.

09:13.684 --> 09:14.684
Don't feel pressured.

09:16.443 --> 09:17.684
Because

09:19.283 --> 09:20.884
he keeps making decisions for me,

09:20.884 --> 09:22.564
telling me what to do.

09:22.684 --> 09:24.363
But I don't like it at all.

09:24.564 --> 09:26.283
That's why I got agitated

09:26.283 --> 09:27.564
when I heard what you said.

09:28.083 --> 09:28.965
If you don't like it,

09:28.965 --> 09:30.123
why don't you tell him?

09:32.403 --> 09:34.323
I don't want to disappoint him

09:34.443 --> 09:36.283
or let it affect our relationship.

09:36.524 --> 09:37.924
But you're getting affected now.

09:38.564 --> 09:39.844
If you keep it to yourself,

09:39.844 --> 09:41.403
he will never know how you feel.

09:41.764 --> 09:42.443
You will end up

09:42.443 --> 09:44.083
finding him boring one day.

09:44.083 --> 09:45.564
And he won't know what went wrong.

09:46.604 --> 09:47.444
Exactly.

09:47.444 --> 09:48.724
It's the 21st century.

09:48.844 --> 09:50.323
Say what you have to say.

09:50.684 --> 09:51.803
Start expressing yourself

09:51.803 --> 09:53.123
in your relationships.

09:53.123 --> 09:55.004
It gets me so anxious
just to hear about it.

09:55.004 --> 09:56.443
Yeah, she is right.

10:18.684 --> 10:19.684
Tianqi.

10:19.924 --> 10:21.443
Your girlfriend studies architecture?

10:21.684 --> 10:22.684
Yeah.

10:23.283 --> 10:24.483
Can you send me

10:24.684 --> 10:25.684
her course schedule?

10:26.123 --> 10:27.123
What for?

10:27.884 --> 10:29.004
To sit in on the classes.

10:34.083 --> 10:34.684
There you go.

10:34.924 --> 10:35.483
Thanks.

10:35.483 --> 10:36.483
No problem.

10:44.474 --> 10:48.147
(Timetable for Huaguang University's
School of Architecture's Courses)

11:08.403 --> 11:08.984
- Have to line up.
- Okay.

11:08.984 --> 11:09.524
If you...

11:09.524 --> 11:10.524
Xu Zhi.

12:21.550 --> 12:24.408
♪In the darkness,
you are like fireworks♪

12:24.408 --> 12:27.384
♪Unattainable♪

12:27.384 --> 12:29.848
♪How much time is needed♪

12:30.360 --> 12:34.959
♪To vividly sketch♪

12:37.304 --> 12:40.310
♪Peel away the soft shell♪

12:40.310 --> 12:43.118
♪I want to understand your fragility♪

12:43.288 --> 12:45.659
♪The sky will have the morning sun♪

12:45.891 --> 12:50.008
♪And you always have me♪

12:50.520 --> 12:52.537
♪Don't be afraid,
what you've experienced♪

12:52.537 --> 12:55.000
♪Remains in the heart♪

12:55.384 --> 12:56.952
♪You will fulfill the past♪

12:56.952 --> 12:59.124
♪Dream you long for♪

12:59.377 --> 13:02.904
♪Open your arms to embrace the breeze♪

13:02.904 --> 13:06.200
♪Together with you♪

13:06.200 --> 13:08.088
♪Look, this city♪

13:08.088 --> 13:11.192
♪It keeps raining♪

13:11.192 --> 13:13.144
♪Ticking and tattling♪

13:13.144 --> 13:14.936
♪Who is worried♪

13:14.936 --> 13:18.539
♪I believe
you can't find a reason either♪

13:18.951 --> 13:22.021
♪Don't give it an answer♪

13:22.744 --> 13:26.906
♪I'm the same♪

13:30.804 --> 13:31.964
How about breakfast together?

13:32.724 --> 13:34.644
Waiting outside my dorm? What a cliché.

13:34.724 --> 13:36.083
It's too outdated to be you.

13:36.644 --> 13:37.644
I don't mind clichés.

13:38.604 --> 13:39.604
I just want to see you.

13:41.083 --> 13:42.083
You saw me.

13:42.604 --> 13:43.604
You can leave.

13:56.604 --> 13:57.604
Thanks.

14:02.924 --> 14:03.924
Thanks.

14:21.163 --> 14:22.163
What time did you come?

14:23.083 --> 14:24.083
At 4 AM.

14:24.764 --> 14:26.123
Why didn't you text me first?

14:26.684 --> 14:27.684
I did.

14:28.163 --> 14:29.163
You didn't reply.

14:29.363 --> 14:30.283
You sent an emoji.

14:30.283 --> 14:31.483
What should I reply?

14:34.083 --> 14:35.243
I know you're busy today.

14:35.524 --> 14:36.604
I won't waste too much

14:36.924 --> 14:37.924
of your time.

14:38.004 --> 14:39.403
How do you know I'm busy today?

14:39.804 --> 14:41.283
I live in the same dorm

14:41.283 --> 14:42.283
as your roommate

14:42.564 --> 14:43.564
Liu Yisi's boyfriend.

14:44.684 --> 14:46.123
I asked for your course schedule.

14:46.804 --> 14:48.443
You're roommates with Zhao Tianqi?

14:52.924 --> 14:53.565
Alright.

14:53.565 --> 14:54.804
You've said enough.

14:56.043 --> 14:57.564
Now you can stay quiet.

15:00.884 --> 15:01.884
I don't drink milk.

15:13.163 --> 15:14.323
Is it fun to mess with me?

15:19.604 --> 15:21.243
You're allowed one more sentence.

15:24.203 --> 15:25.203
I didn't mean it.

15:25.684 --> 15:26.684
Something happened.

15:28.004 --> 15:29.724
There was a bombing case in Ruicheng.

15:30.884 --> 15:31.884
My mom changed her mind

15:31.884 --> 15:32.964
and allowed me to stay.

15:35.363 --> 15:36.363
And then?

15:38.524 --> 15:40.243
I wanted to retake Grade 12.

15:40.844 --> 15:42.163
But I saw the enrollment plan

15:42.163 --> 15:43.684
on Huaguang's website.

15:44.043 --> 15:45.964
Public Administration major
didn't fill up.

15:45.964 --> 15:47.203
I thought it was destiny.

15:47.684 --> 15:49.724
So I applied to see how it would go.

15:51.363 --> 15:52.724
Why didn't you tell me?

15:53.684 --> 15:55.083
I didn't know if it would work.

15:55.443 --> 15:56.443
So I didn't tell you.

15:57.884 --> 15:59.564
Will you stick to this major?

16:00.564 --> 16:01.644
I'll go for Economics

16:01.884 --> 16:03.083
or pursue a double degree.

16:06.203 --> 16:07.203
Alright.

16:07.403 --> 16:09.083
Catch up on this month's classes first

16:09.083 --> 16:10.083
and we'll see.

16:10.964 --> 16:12.644
You won't understand anything

16:13.604 --> 16:15.203
about advanced math this afternoon.

16:16.724 --> 16:17.964
You have my schedule, too?

16:19.564 --> 16:20.803
Where will you sit?

16:20.803 --> 16:21.804
Front or back row?

16:22.004 --> 16:23.043
So what?

16:23.043 --> 16:24.043
Want to sit next to me?

16:24.724 --> 16:25.724
No.

16:26.283 --> 16:27.283
I just want to see

16:27.283 --> 16:28.284
how the brainiac

16:28.284 --> 16:29.884
fails to understand anything in class.

16:31.924 --> 16:32.924
Alright.

17:01.243 --> 17:02.363
When did them cross paths?

17:03.283 --> 17:04.283
No idea.

17:05.684 --> 17:07.043
You're bold enough

17:07.483 --> 17:08.884
to sit in the front row.

17:10.004 --> 17:11.004
Where did you go?

17:11.283 --> 17:12.403
The publicity department

17:12.844 --> 17:13.844
held a long meeting.

17:14.163 --> 17:15.163
You're quite busy.

17:15.363 --> 17:16.564
Addicted to power?

17:16.884 --> 17:18.083
Mind your own business.

17:19.764 --> 17:20.764
Which one of you

17:21.203 --> 17:22.363
would like to come up

17:22.644 --> 17:23.804
and solve this problem?

17:29.283 --> 17:31.604
I guess some students
have done their homework.

17:32.564 --> 17:33.564
Young lady,

17:34.004 --> 17:36.924
will you solve this problem?

17:37.283 --> 17:38.283
Okay.

17:40.203 --> 17:41.004
The answer is here.

17:41.163 --> 17:42.203
Do the calculation.

17:42.524 --> 17:43.032
Lagrange...

17:43.032 --> 17:43.565
Thanks.

17:43.565 --> 17:45.043
Let's give her some encouragement.

17:51.043 --> 17:52.924
We encounter many problems

17:53.203 --> 17:55.403
while answering the questions.

17:56.004 --> 17:58.163
Solving problems
is both easy and difficult.

17:59.004 --> 18:00.524
When you review

18:00.524 --> 18:01.564
the laws

18:02.724 --> 18:03.724
and theorems,

18:04.363 --> 18:05.884
it's crucial to understand them

18:06.964 --> 18:08.203
thoroughly.

18:18.243 --> 18:19.243
Alright.

18:22.283 --> 18:23.283
Actually,

18:23.964 --> 18:24.964
this problem

18:25.884 --> 18:28.123
can be solved with

18:28.524 --> 18:29.524
Lagrange's theorem.

18:29.524 --> 18:31.283
Try to solve it with the theorem

18:31.283 --> 18:32.323
you learned today.

18:33.323 --> 18:34.443
I'll give you some time.

18:35.363 --> 18:36.163
Okay?

18:36.283 --> 18:37.764
Okay.

18:42.684 --> 18:44.123
You studied at home, didn't you?

18:45.203 --> 18:46.924
You even knew Lagrange.

18:47.800 --> 18:49.163
I learned it in high school.

18:50.123 --> 18:51.563
I didn't expect him to cover

18:51.563 --> 18:53.243
definite integrals in just one month.

18:53.524 --> 18:54.644
I was just lucky

18:54.924 --> 18:56.243
that I've learned it.

18:58.163 --> 18:59.884
You learned that in high school?

19:00.323 --> 19:01.884
You're way too competitive.

19:02.403 --> 19:03.403
I learned it

19:04.283 --> 19:05.483
for the physics competition.

19:05.880 --> 19:06.525
This theorem

19:06.525 --> 19:08.323
is more useful in physics competitions.

19:09.083 --> 19:10.083
Okay.

19:10.564 --> 19:11.564
Have you finished?

19:12.163 --> 19:14.043
Look at the next question in the book.

19:14.043 --> 19:15.203
What's the answer?

19:19.004 --> 19:20.004
Young man,

19:21.004 --> 19:22.004
tell us your answer.

19:26.043 --> 19:27.043
Maybe B.

19:27.043 --> 19:28.083
A.

19:30.123 --> 19:31.684
This young lady is correct.

19:32.764 --> 19:33.764
The answer

19:34.123 --> 19:35.123
is

19:35.323 --> 19:36.323
A.

19:43.764 --> 19:44.764
That's impressive.

19:45.363 --> 19:47.323
Still amazing at multitasking.

19:48.004 --> 19:49.804
Try to understand it.

19:53.604 --> 19:54.604
What are they saying?

19:55.123 --> 19:56.123
I can't hear them.

20:01.483 --> 20:02.483
You free this weekend?

20:02.644 --> 20:03.203
Why?

20:03.483 --> 20:04.604
Let me help you with math.

20:07.564 --> 20:08.724
Ever watched The Disguiser?

20:10.483 --> 20:11.483
"Ming Lou.

20:11.604 --> 20:12.604
On your knees.

20:13.004 --> 20:14.163
Do me a favor."

20:16.684 --> 20:17.924
That's how you sounded.

20:20.524 --> 20:21.844
You can help me with math.

20:23.163 --> 20:24.163
I'm busy.

20:27.323 --> 20:28.403
They're so close.

20:29.203 --> 20:30.283
I bet there's something.

20:33.443 --> 20:34.763
Come clean.

20:34.763 --> 20:36.764
What's your deal with that handsome guy?

20:37.443 --> 20:38.364
I took the empty seat

20:38.364 --> 20:39.804
next to him because I was late.

20:40.083 --> 20:41.323
Come on.

20:41.323 --> 20:43.083
Did you know each other?

20:43.443 --> 20:44.644
We both come from Qingyi.

20:46.163 --> 20:47.084
No wonder.

20:47.084 --> 20:48.764
You talked for almost half the class.

20:48.764 --> 20:49.844
Looks like you had fun.

20:50.283 --> 20:51.044
Do you think

20:51.044 --> 20:52.724
that he's a bit into you?

20:54.203 --> 20:55.203
Maybe a little.

20:56.924 --> 20:59.083
If I had half your confidence,

20:59.483 --> 21:01.004
I'd already have a boyfriend.

21:06.964 --> 21:08.604
(Chen Luzhou: Zhi, help.)

21:08.884 --> 21:09.483
What happened?

21:09.483 --> 21:10.483
(Stop pretending.)

21:11.004 --> 21:12.362
(It's too easy for you.)

21:12.362 --> 21:13.363
(Catch up on lessons.)

21:14.403 --> 21:15.403
Something's fishy.

21:18.163 --> 21:18.884
(I'll do my best.)

21:19.083 --> 21:20.564
(Guess I'll have to stay up late.)

21:21.004 --> 21:23.443
(Perfect. Don't wait for me
for breakfast.)

21:23.884 --> 21:24.884
(Let's eat separately.)

21:25.203 --> 21:26.203
(Are you going to eat)

21:26.684 --> 21:27.684
(with Jiang Yu?)

21:29.203 --> 21:30.203
(Oh, come on.)

21:30.724 --> 21:31.883
(Didn't you tell Zhu Yangqi)

21:31.883 --> 21:33.203
(that I could date anyone?)

21:38.004 --> 21:39.004
Hello.

21:39.524 --> 21:41.043
What else did Zhu Yangqi tell you?

21:41.804 --> 21:42.564
Nothing much.

21:42.804 --> 21:43.804
Focus on your study.

21:44.323 --> 21:45.764
Talk after the midterm exams.

21:46.043 --> 21:47.043
Alright.

21:47.043 --> 21:48.403
Once I catch up on the lessons,

21:48.403 --> 21:49.403
let's talk properly.

21:51.403 --> 21:52.403
Chen Luzhou.

21:53.123 --> 21:54.123
You're so lame.

21:54.243 --> 21:56.323
I thought the brainiac
would know everything.

21:56.644 --> 21:58.764
The brainiac doesn't necessarily
know everything.

21:59.163 --> 22:00.804
But once I put in a little effort,

22:00.804 --> 22:01.804
I'll master everything.

22:02.604 --> 22:04.363
Who was asking for my help just now?

22:04.844 --> 22:05.884
My brother.

22:05.884 --> 22:06.884
Chen Sanzhou.

22:07.884 --> 22:08.884
Alright.

22:08.884 --> 22:11.043
Let's see how much you score
in the midterm exams.

22:11.604 --> 22:14.403
I'm also waiting to be surprised
by the dark horse from Qingyi.

22:15.764 --> 22:17.443
Just wait and see. Bye.

22:20.964 --> 22:22.604
Dark horse from Qingyi?

22:23.203 --> 22:24.443
Then what are you?

22:24.684 --> 22:25.844
White goose from Qingyi?

22:28.884 --> 22:30.443
(Cai Yingying: Ready to apologize.)

22:30.564 --> 22:32.043
(Zhi, please show up.)

22:43.443 --> 22:45.363
Twenty-four hours have passed.

22:45.363 --> 22:47.083
Am I your best girlfriend again?

22:47.403 --> 22:48.604
Where is my best girlfriend?

22:48.884 --> 22:51.243
I only see an opportunist.

22:51.604 --> 22:53.563
I promise it won't happen again.

22:53.563 --> 22:54.684
No matter what they offer,

22:54.684 --> 22:56.163
my bestie comes first.

22:56.163 --> 22:56.844
I swear.

22:56.844 --> 22:57.804
If I break my promise...

22:57.804 --> 22:58.392
Enough.

22:58.524 --> 22:59.524
Next time, no mercy.

23:02.644 --> 23:04.764
So Chen Luzhou spoke with you?

23:06.163 --> 23:07.764
Are you going to forgive him?

23:09.483 --> 23:10.483
Let him be for now.

23:11.764 --> 23:12.764
Alright.

23:26.584 --> 23:28.481
(Timetable for Huaguang University's
School of Architecture's Courses)

23:31.964 --> 23:33.043
Xu Zhi forgave you?

23:35.004 --> 23:36.004
Sort of.

23:37.564 --> 23:39.083
Focus on the study in the library.

23:39.203 --> 23:40.203
Stop talking.

23:44.083 --> 23:45.083
So, what's going on

23:45.283 --> 23:46.644
between you two right now?

23:48.203 --> 23:49.203
What are your plans?

23:49.283 --> 23:50.804
Don't you know my plans?

23:51.004 --> 23:52.004
How would I know...

23:54.203 --> 23:55.443
Is this seat taken?

23:56.363 --> 23:57.363
- Well...
- No.

23:58.684 --> 23:59.684
Okay.

24:04.363 --> 24:06.483
Isn't she the belle majoring in English?

24:06.764 --> 24:07.764
Are you doing this

24:07.964 --> 24:09.123
to make Xu Zhi jealous?

24:10.163 --> 24:12.043
Do you have to be so provocative?

24:12.604 --> 24:13.644
If you have the time,

24:13.644 --> 24:14.884
help me solve this inequation.

24:16.564 --> 24:18.243
You used to ignore girls like her.

24:19.083 --> 24:20.083
Chen Luzhou.

24:24.804 --> 24:26.322
Our senior from the photography club

24:26.322 --> 24:28.203
wonders if you're interested
in joining us.

24:28.483 --> 24:29.483
No.

24:29.644 --> 24:30.644
Sorry.

24:35.924 --> 24:37.403
There will be a basketball game.

24:37.483 --> 24:39.684
I heard you brought a drone.

24:39.804 --> 24:41.243
- May I borrow it...?
- Sorry.

24:42.684 --> 24:44.004
Let's cut to the chase.

24:52.724 --> 24:53.363
We can go

24:53.363 --> 24:54.363
somewhere else.

25:09.403 --> 25:10.403
Your hometown fellow.

25:10.804 --> 25:12.804
I think she's the belle
majoring in English.

25:16.844 --> 25:17.844
Xu Zhi.

25:18.604 --> 25:19.604
What a coincidence.

25:21.443 --> 25:22.443
("What a coincidence?")

25:22.964 --> 25:23.844
(Someone's jealous.)

25:23.844 --> 25:24.844
Thank you.

25:25.684 --> 25:26.684
Let's go.

25:27.524 --> 25:29.283
Do you have a girlfriend?

25:30.123 --> 25:31.123
No.

25:32.024 --> 25:32.925
Then can I...

25:32.925 --> 25:34.684
But I'm trying to win my ex back.

25:35.283 --> 25:36.564
Ex-girlfriend? Who?

25:38.964 --> 25:40.644
You said you knew him.

25:41.123 --> 25:42.524
Does his ex-girlfriend look

25:42.524 --> 25:43.363
extremely pretty?

25:43.524 --> 25:44.363
She's alright.

25:44.524 --> 25:45.203
Not too bad.

25:45.403 --> 25:46.924
Don't tell me you're jealous.

25:47.363 --> 25:48.363
- Sorry.
- Of whom?

25:48.443 --> 25:49.604
Chen Luzhou's ex-girlfriend.

25:50.724 --> 25:51.724
You're right.

26:14.283 --> 26:15.283
She saw you?

26:16.564 --> 26:17.564
Yeah, downstairs.

26:18.604 --> 26:19.684
Did she say anything?

26:21.684 --> 26:22.764
"What a coincidence."

26:24.123 --> 26:25.123
She got jealous.

26:25.604 --> 26:27.724
Talk to her and explain it now.

26:28.283 --> 26:28.964
Let her be

26:29.203 --> 26:30.203
for a while.

26:36.884 --> 26:37.884
Hold on.

26:38.483 --> 26:39.724
Why do I feel

26:40.004 --> 26:41.363
that she is not jealous?

26:51.644 --> 26:53.083
I don't think she is jealous.

26:53.884 --> 26:54.884
She's pretending.

26:55.243 --> 26:56.524
Serenity before the storm.

26:58.283 --> 26:59.283
Come on.

26:59.283 --> 27:00.084
You have never

27:00.084 --> 27:01.764
seen a girl getting jealous, huh?

27:01.844 --> 27:02.844
Have you?

27:03.043 --> 27:04.243
I-I...

27:04.684 --> 27:05.724
I haven't dated anyone,

27:05.964 --> 27:06.964
but I'm sure that

27:07.323 --> 27:09.363
a girl would complain if she is jealous.

27:10.083 --> 27:11.283
What are you trying to say?

27:14.844 --> 27:16.083
Bro, here's my advice.

27:16.483 --> 27:17.564
If she's jealous,

27:18.083 --> 27:19.443
it might be a good thing.

27:19.564 --> 27:21.363
At least, she cares about you.

27:21.964 --> 27:23.043
But if she's not jealous,

27:23.403 --> 27:24.804
then it's a big problem.

27:25.524 --> 27:26.844
It means she has already

27:27.604 --> 27:29.004
moved on.

27:39.524 --> 27:40.524
Get lost.

27:47.443 --> 27:49.443
Look, is it this one?

27:50.764 --> 27:51.764
It's different.

27:52.283 --> 27:54.043
This style. This one.

27:54.163 --> 27:55.163
It's this one.

27:57.724 --> 27:59.123
Let your arms drop naturally.

28:01.363 --> 28:02.363
Chen Luzhou?

28:05.403 --> 28:07.004
What's wrong? What do you want?

28:08.844 --> 28:10.043
Nothing. I'm just curious

28:11.004 --> 28:13.323
if Xu Zhi has mentioned me these days.

28:14.243 --> 28:15.724
No, she hasn't. Why?

28:17.604 --> 28:18.243
She

28:18.403 --> 28:20.203
is probably still mad at me, right?

28:21.363 --> 28:23.123
I don't know if she's mad at you.

28:23.243 --> 28:24.844
But don't call me in private again.

28:25.083 --> 28:26.524
Otherwise, she'll be mad at me.

28:26.684 --> 28:27.684
Bye-bye.

29:06.964 --> 29:08.483
(Bro, here's my advice.)

29:08.764 --> 29:09.804
(If she's jealous,)

29:10.123 --> 29:11.403
it might be a good thing.

29:11.564 --> 29:13.043
At least, she cares about you.

29:13.684 --> 29:14.804
But if she's not jealous,

29:15.323 --> 29:18.283
it means she's already moved on.

29:24.144 --> 29:26.328
(Call from Her Majesty)

29:32.483 --> 29:33.924
Hello, Luzhou.

29:35.884 --> 29:36.964
You've been busy, huh?

29:38.604 --> 29:41.363
I know you didn't take that card.

29:42.644 --> 29:45.043
I'll transfer the money to your WeChat

29:45.123 --> 29:46.323
every month.

29:46.443 --> 29:47.684
Stop sending me money.

29:48.203 --> 29:49.884
I'll try to get a scholarship.

29:50.483 --> 29:52.443
The scholarship is 15,000 yuan tops.

29:53.724 --> 29:55.804
What will be left
after paying the tuition?

29:57.604 --> 29:59.243
I've also done some part-time jobs.

29:59.804 --> 30:01.443
I can save money.

30:02.123 --> 30:03.123
I know.

30:04.443 --> 30:06.524
But as long as you keep going to school,

30:07.163 --> 30:10.564
I have the right and duty
to support you.

30:12.043 --> 30:14.323
I'll transfer the money
to you every month.

30:14.323 --> 30:15.323
You can decide

30:15.604 --> 30:16.764
whether you spend it.

30:17.083 --> 30:18.083
Okay?

30:20.924 --> 30:22.203
I missed you a lot.

30:23.684 --> 30:26.043
Take care of yourself out there.

30:31.323 --> 30:32.323
Bye.

30:39.656 --> 30:42.712
(10,000 yuan from Mom)

31:02.323 --> 31:03.323
Luzhou.

31:04.804 --> 31:05.804
You're back?

31:06.243 --> 31:08.163
You can check the school forum

31:08.283 --> 31:09.283
for part-time jobs.

31:11.644 --> 31:12.644
You misunderstood.

31:13.123 --> 31:14.844
I just hate to spend my parents' money.

31:17.884 --> 31:18.644
I knew it.

31:18.844 --> 31:20.163
Judging from your drone,

31:20.283 --> 31:21.924
your family should be doing fine.

31:23.884 --> 31:24.483
But are you

31:24.804 --> 31:26.243
really going for a scholarship?

31:28.483 --> 31:29.483
So ambitious.

31:30.924 --> 31:32.483
But it's not so easy

31:32.724 --> 31:33.924
to get a scholarship.

31:34.203 --> 31:35.564
You need a GPA of above 4.0

31:35.804 --> 31:37.163
for every subject.

31:38.043 --> 31:39.644
Funding opportunities may vary.

31:40.764 --> 31:42.844
Could it be harder
than winning my ex back?

31:43.804 --> 31:44.804
Wait.

31:45.163 --> 31:47.123
You asked me for that timetable

31:47.123 --> 31:48.564
to win your ex back?

31:51.924 --> 31:53.203
A girl from Qingyi?

31:53.564 --> 31:54.564
School of Architecture.

31:56.123 --> 31:57.844
Don't tell me it's Xu Zhi.

32:04.764 --> 32:05.764
What's wrong?

32:06.203 --> 32:07.322
Did Zhao Tianqi tell you

32:07.322 --> 32:08.524
to do something again?

32:10.043 --> 32:10.764
No.

32:10.924 --> 32:12.283
I've made it clear to him.

32:13.163 --> 32:15.203
He won't meddle
with my business anymore.

32:15.483 --> 32:17.243
Then why are you looking so downcast?

32:24.363 --> 32:25.363
Look.

32:25.804 --> 32:26.884
Oh, my God.

32:29.724 --> 32:32.644
"Lacking a basic sense of space."

32:32.924 --> 32:34.443
It's heartbreaking.

32:34.764 --> 32:36.564
Do you think I'll fail the course?

32:37.644 --> 32:38.483
Not really.

32:38.564 --> 32:39.684
It's only the first task.

32:40.323 --> 32:42.964
But our senior said that many people

32:42.964 --> 32:45.123
fail the architecture design course

32:45.123 --> 32:46.123
every year.

32:46.564 --> 32:47.564
What should I do?

32:47.644 --> 32:48.644
Ask Xu Zhi.

32:49.323 --> 32:50.724
Her engineering design plans

32:50.724 --> 32:52.243
scored the highest in our class.

32:52.483 --> 32:54.843
Ms. Xu, please take a look
at my work next time.

32:54.843 --> 32:56.443
Take a look at mine, too.

32:56.443 --> 32:57.443
No problem.

32:57.924 --> 32:58.924
Here.

33:00.123 --> 33:02.123
Ms. Xu, please bless me

33:02.604 --> 33:03.644
to pass the course.

33:03.804 --> 33:05.483
If I were that awesome,

33:05.483 --> 33:06.804
I could get rich

33:07.564 --> 33:08.924
just by selling charms.

33:09.804 --> 33:11.763
I remember our teacher saying

33:11.763 --> 33:13.004
that we can photograph

33:13.004 --> 33:14.603
the exterior of buildings with drones

33:14.603 --> 33:15.844
to help us understand.

33:17.043 --> 33:19.363
I remember that Chen Luzhou had a drone.

33:20.323 --> 33:22.243
Can you borrow it for us, please?

33:23.004 --> 33:24.483
Please, Ms. Xu.

33:25.004 --> 33:26.443
Please.

33:26.644 --> 33:27.364
Xu Zhi.

33:27.364 --> 33:28.684
Alright, I'll give it a try.

33:29.884 --> 33:30.924
We're saved.

33:40.604 --> 33:42.523
(Stylish Zhu: How's it going with Zhi?)

33:42.523 --> 33:45.123
(I've grown tired of eating salad.)

33:45.604 --> 33:46.484
(When can we gather)

33:46.484 --> 33:49.283
(for a nice meal as the Qingyi squad?)

33:52.483 --> 33:53.083
(Got it.)

33:53.363 --> 33:54.363
(Good luck, buddy.)

33:54.724 --> 33:56.724
(A long and arduous journey lies ahead.)

33:58.724 --> 33:59.724
Chen Luzhou is there.

34:01.043 --> 34:02.043
Come on.

34:09.884 --> 34:11.243
Can I ask you for a favor?

34:12.443 --> 34:13.443
Go ahead.

34:13.564 --> 34:15.363
Can I borrow your drone?

34:16.004 --> 34:17.004
Sure.

34:18.363 --> 34:18.884
When?

34:19.283 --> 34:20.283
I can teach you.

34:20.483 --> 34:21.884
Really? That would be great.

34:22.083 --> 34:22.844
No need.

34:22.964 --> 34:23.885
Give me the manual.

34:23.885 --> 34:25.203
I'll figure it out myself.

34:27.604 --> 34:28.844
That's impressive.

34:29.203 --> 34:30.203
So independent.

34:31.363 --> 34:33.203
Aren't you curious why I'm borrowing it?

34:33.323 --> 34:34.483
As long as you don't

34:34.483 --> 34:35.483
film naked guys.

34:42.764 --> 34:44.243
Zhi, you're not mad at me anymore?

34:44.884 --> 34:46.524
Dig in. Stop talking.

34:48.123 --> 34:49.884
Don't you have anything else to say?

34:52.564 --> 34:53.604
Then,

34:54.684 --> 34:55.924
thank you for your drone.

34:57.724 --> 34:59.004
Thank you for the drumstick.

34:59.203 --> 35:00.203
My pleasure.

35:00.604 --> 35:01.604
My pleasure, too.

35:02.724 --> 35:04.924
(What the heck? What's going on?)

35:05.123 --> 35:06.243
(So much flirting.)

35:12.243 --> 35:13.724
She likes to gnaw on chopsticks.

35:15.844 --> 35:16.724
Not at all.

35:16.724 --> 35:17.564
I just really like

35:17.564 --> 35:19.043
digging into gossip.

35:19.043 --> 35:20.604
And I have a keen eye

35:20.604 --> 35:21.924
for big scoops.

35:22.363 --> 35:24.123
What's there to gossip about us?

35:24.283 --> 35:24.844
I guess

35:24.844 --> 35:26.644
you didn't lie to us at all.

35:26.644 --> 35:28.724
This handsome guy is a bit into you.

35:29.684 --> 35:30.684
Really?

35:32.724 --> 35:34.163
What do you mean by "a bit"?

35:35.323 --> 35:36.323
No idea.

35:40.964 --> 35:42.282
You seem to enjoy the meal.

35:42.282 --> 35:43.083
I'm full.

35:43.203 --> 35:44.043
Take your time.

35:44.043 --> 35:45.043
I'm off.

35:53.403 --> 35:54.524
What did you say about me?

35:55.483 --> 35:57.283
She said I was jealous of your ex

35:57.684 --> 36:00.403
and claimed the grapes to be sour
because I couldn't have them.

36:02.403 --> 36:04.243
If you're so jealous
of my ex-girlfriend,

36:04.243 --> 36:05.524
you can admit it.

36:06.283 --> 36:07.564
Also, the grapes are sweet.

36:07.964 --> 36:08.964
I suggest you try them.

36:12.363 --> 36:14.443
You left and came back as you pleased.

36:14.684 --> 36:16.884
Not everyone is lined up,
waiting for your call.

36:17.283 --> 36:19.203
Also, I'm quite jealous of your ex.

36:19.564 --> 36:21.403
You weren't this obnoxious back then.

36:23.403 --> 36:25.123
I'll run everything by my girlfriend.

36:25.844 --> 36:28.043
A decent ex should
maintain proper boundaries.

36:28.804 --> 36:29.804
So that you can

36:30.123 --> 36:31.123
start dating someone?

36:32.884 --> 36:34.483
So that you can start dating someone.

36:34.844 --> 36:35.883
Now everyone knows

36:35.883 --> 36:36.964
that I'm trying to win

36:36.964 --> 36:37.964
my ex back at Huaguang.

36:38.243 --> 36:39.283
Who's going to date me?

36:39.804 --> 36:40.564
Who knows?

36:40.764 --> 36:41.483
Chen Luzhou.

36:41.764 --> 36:42.884
Can I add you on WeChat?

36:47.483 --> 36:49.043
You might have to ask my ex first.

36:51.243 --> 36:52.243
Sorry about that.

36:59.363 --> 37:00.884
So awkward. How come...

37:00.884 --> 37:02.163
But they were so sweet.

37:03.524 --> 37:04.964
- Xu Zhi.
- Xu Zhi.

37:04.964 --> 37:05.964
What's wrong?

37:07.964 --> 37:08.964
Come on, sit.

37:09.604 --> 37:11.043
Oh my, Xu Zhi.

37:11.123 --> 37:12.683
I never realized it.

37:12.683 --> 37:15.644
So you were Chen Luzhou's ex-girlfriend?

37:16.483 --> 37:19.443
Oh my, you hid it so well.

37:20.203 --> 37:21.483
So,

37:21.884 --> 37:22.924
are you back together?

37:23.363 --> 37:25.163
It's all in the past. We've moved on.

37:25.524 --> 37:26.684
No way.

37:27.004 --> 37:28.523
You were flirting with each other

37:28.523 --> 37:30.004
at the canteen.

37:30.403 --> 37:32.004
He couldn't keep his eyes off you.

37:32.764 --> 37:34.403
You obviously have feelings

37:34.403 --> 37:35.524
for each other.

37:36.564 --> 37:37.564
I almost forgot.

37:38.724 --> 37:40.924
It will be my birthday tomorrow.

37:41.123 --> 37:43.804
I was going to celebrate
with my boyfriend

37:44.163 --> 37:46.083
and his roommate Chen Luzhou.

37:48.243 --> 37:49.724
But if you mind it,

37:49.844 --> 37:50.764
I won't invite him.

37:50.844 --> 37:51.844
Wait.

37:52.323 --> 37:55.283
Chen Luzhou
is your boyfriend's roommate?

37:56.884 --> 37:59.203
And he is also
my roommate's ex-boyfriend.

37:59.403 --> 38:00.604
Such a coincidence?

38:01.043 --> 38:02.162
How can we not invite him?

38:02.162 --> 38:03.323
We must invite him.

38:03.323 --> 38:04.363
Right, Xu Zhi?

38:06.004 --> 38:07.363
Didn't you say you'd moved on?

38:07.363 --> 38:09.123
So, you definitely wouldn't mind it.

38:09.924 --> 38:10.924
Go ahead.

38:11.363 --> 38:12.363
I don't mind.

38:12.483 --> 38:13.524
Let's see if he comes.

38:13.924 --> 38:14.684
She agreed.

38:14.764 --> 38:15.524
I'll invite him.

38:15.524 --> 38:16.163
Come on.

38:16.524 --> 38:17.524
Come on.

38:27.403 --> 38:28.524
Sorry, I'm late.

38:29.203 --> 38:30.323
Meet my boyfriend, Tianqi.

38:30.323 --> 38:30.844
Hello.

38:31.083 --> 38:31.644
Hello.

38:32.043 --> 38:33.524
Thanks for joining Yisi's birthday.

38:33.844 --> 38:34.964
- Birthday cake!
- Birthday cake.

38:35.203 --> 38:36.004
Thank you.

38:36.004 --> 38:37.004
Happy birthday.

38:37.123 --> 38:37.724
Thank you.

38:38.004 --> 38:39.004
This is...

38:39.384 --> 38:39.965
Hello.

38:39.965 --> 38:41.403
This is Chen Luzhou from Qingyi.

38:42.403 --> 38:44.564
Save it. We got it.

38:47.964 --> 38:48.964
Thanks.

38:50.323 --> 38:51.243
It's a cream cake.

38:51.243 --> 38:51.844
Creamy?

38:51.844 --> 38:52.844
Thank you.

38:54.203 --> 38:55.203
He's quite handsome.

38:57.283 --> 38:58.363
Did I embarrass you?

38:58.884 --> 39:00.724
No, you look great today.

39:04.043 --> 39:05.363
How about we order first?

39:05.764 --> 39:06.764
Alright.

39:08.844 --> 39:09.845
I bet Jiang Yu

39:09.845 --> 39:12.323
is crying his heart out in the bathroom.

39:12.804 --> 39:14.283
I'm quite straightforward.

39:14.884 --> 39:15.884
I'll just say it.

39:16.083 --> 39:17.083
Chen Luzhou.

39:17.483 --> 39:18.563
When are you going to

39:18.563 --> 39:20.924
make yourself her current boyfriend?

39:20.924 --> 39:22.684
He became my ex-boyfriend

39:22.684 --> 39:24.243
for a reason, of course.

39:25.323 --> 39:26.363
Life is so long.

39:26.483 --> 39:28.363
Why fall into the same pit twice?

39:30.455 --> 39:31.929
(Two days ago)

39:41.123 --> 39:42.283
- Nice shot.
- Nice shot.

39:42.604 --> 39:43.123
Nice shot.

39:43.604 --> 39:44.724
The match is over.

39:44.844 --> 39:46.242
Public Administration won.

39:46.242 --> 39:46.965
Next up.

39:46.965 --> 39:48.363
Public Affairs vs. Philosophy.

39:48.363 --> 39:49.764
Senior, you finally came.

39:50.004 --> 39:51.004
We're counting on you.

39:51.283 --> 39:52.283
How was it?

41:22.296 --> 41:23.192
Nice shot.

41:31.403 --> 41:32.403
Tianqi.

41:32.728 --> 41:33.304
Practice more.

41:33.304 --> 41:33.924
Let's go.

41:33.924 --> 41:34.724
We go to practice.

41:34.724 --> 41:35.724
See you.

41:37.844 --> 41:38.844
Take a break.

42:00.363 --> 42:01.443
You are

42:02.243 --> 42:03.524
Xu Zhi's ex-boyfriend,

42:03.884 --> 42:05.004
Chen Luzhou, right?

42:06.764 --> 42:08.564
You are Xu Zhi's superior,
Jiang Yu, right?

42:09.644 --> 42:10.644
You play well.

42:11.203 --> 42:12.203
You too.

42:13.884 --> 42:14.884
By the way,

42:15.083 --> 42:16.604
I want to offer you

42:16.964 --> 42:18.123
a piece of advice.

42:19.604 --> 42:20.604
Go ahead.

42:21.483 --> 42:23.724
The publicity department
holds too many meetings.

42:24.323 --> 42:25.843
If there aren't urgent matters

42:25.843 --> 42:26.524
to discuss,

42:26.644 --> 42:27.924
please try to end

42:28.283 --> 42:29.403
the meetings on time

42:30.004 --> 42:31.323
and let Zhi attend her classes.

42:32.163 --> 42:34.203
Got it. I'll pay attention to it.

42:35.123 --> 42:36.123
Speaking of which,

42:37.004 --> 42:38.083
here's my advice.

42:42.724 --> 42:43.804
Cherish what you have.

42:45.644 --> 42:47.363
If you don't know how to do that,

42:47.764 --> 42:49.323
then just remain her ex-boyfriend.

42:49.564 --> 42:51.283
Don't hurt her again.

42:54.604 --> 42:56.004
Did she tell you I hurt her?

42:57.764 --> 42:59.043
She never mentioned you.

42:59.724 --> 43:01.403
Then why did you say that I hurt her?

43:04.924 --> 43:05.924
Do you know

43:06.564 --> 43:08.604
why she accepted me
as a friend on WeChat?

43:11.403 --> 43:12.684
My profile picture was also

43:13.004 --> 43:14.004
Neuschwanstein Castle.

43:14.483 --> 43:15.644
She thought it was

43:15.644 --> 43:16.644
your spare account.

43:22.644 --> 43:24.004
The earrings were from you, right?

43:26.283 --> 43:27.684
She lost them on the night

43:27.764 --> 43:28.764
of the freshman gathering

43:29.243 --> 43:30.283
and looked everywhere.

43:30.564 --> 43:31.884
I found them for her.

43:32.363 --> 43:33.363
She was very grateful.

43:33.764 --> 43:35.004
She said those earrings

43:35.283 --> 43:36.604
meant a lot to her.

43:41.004 --> 43:42.004
It's time to play.

43:44.203 --> 43:45.483
Don't let your guard down.

43:45.604 --> 43:46.804
Don't give me a chance.

43:50.243 --> 43:51.243
(Ke.)

43:51.964 --> 43:53.524
(You're very wrong.)

43:54.684 --> 43:56.403
(Who told you she's moved on?)

43:56.964 --> 43:57.964
Come on.

43:57.964 --> 43:59.203
To all of us.

43:59.764 --> 44:00.283
Cheers.

44:00.443 --> 44:01.004
Cheers.

44:01.283 --> 44:02.443
Lower the cup.

44:06.443 --> 44:07.724
So bossy with your boyfriend?

44:07.924 --> 44:09.403
Mind your own business.

44:09.564 --> 44:10.564
Shut up and eat.

44:10.724 --> 44:11.283
Seriously.

44:11.644 --> 44:14.763
♪Happy birthday to me♪

44:14.763 --> 44:15.404
Senior.

44:15.404 --> 44:16.683
♪Happy birthday to me♪

44:16.683 --> 44:18.644
It's just the two of us left.

44:18.644 --> 44:20.003
Yeah, just the two of us.

44:20.003 --> 44:23.243
- ♪Happy birthday to me♪
- ♪Happy birthday to you♪

44:23.524 --> 44:25.564
♪Happy birthday to you♪

44:25.964 --> 44:27.043
Why aren't you singing?

44:27.043 --> 44:27.764
It's my birthday.

44:27.764 --> 44:28.764
Alright.

44:28.964 --> 44:31.242
♪Happy birthday to me♪

44:31.765 --> 44:32.804
Wait.

44:33.283 --> 44:34.724
I'm not happy.

44:36.644 --> 44:38.924
Did I kill someone to reincarnate

44:39.243 --> 44:41.564
into an architecture student?

44:42.724 --> 44:44.082
I regret it.

44:44.082 --> 44:46.123
I want to change majors, Yisi.

44:46.724 --> 44:47.443
I-I'll join you.

44:47.443 --> 44:48.483
It's going to rain.

44:49.604 --> 44:50.604
You're the best.

44:51.192 --> 44:51.725
Oh, my God.

44:51.725 --> 44:52.923
- It's raining.
- It's raining.

44:52.923 --> 44:53.483
Hurry up.

44:53.483 --> 44:54.803
The quilt is out there.

44:54.803 --> 44:55.363
It's raining.

44:55.483 --> 44:57.123
The heavens have shown a miracle.

44:57.123 --> 45:03.171
♪Listen to the cicadas in the midsummer♪

45:04.099 --> 45:06.808
♪The reflection in your eyes♪

45:07.653 --> 45:12.195
♪A brilliant scenery♪

45:12.899 --> 45:18.673
♪Moonlight spills over
the endless clear sky♪

45:19.504 --> 45:23.764
♪The roar of the heartbeat♪

45:23.764 --> 45:24.764
Have you missed me?

45:25.403 --> 45:26.403
No.

45:30.644 --> 45:32.123
Still holding a grudge, huh?

45:33.083 --> 45:34.964
Is that new to you?

45:37.035 --> 45:40.139
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

45:40.555 --> 45:44.600
♪Fervent, boiling love♪

45:45.291 --> 45:49.275
♪How you long for the future♪

45:49.643 --> 45:52.843
♪Charging recklessly, getting hurt♪

45:53.035 --> 45:55.990
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

45:55.990 --> 46:00.331
♪If tears fill your eyes♪

46:00.843 --> 46:04.812
♪Let the damp wind stay in memories♪

46:05.081 --> 46:11.455
♪We stand by each other among the crowd♪

46:12.779 --> 46:18.553
♪Let moonlight reply instead of longing♪

46:19.384 --> 46:23.416
♪Turn the incomplete shadow♪

46:23.416 --> 46:27.992
♪Into luck♪

46:29.272 --> 46:32.344
♪Crush, fulfilling the only greed♪

46:32.344 --> 46:35.544
(But she is different.)

46:35.672 --> 46:39.318
(Her story brought hope to many people.)

46:39.398 --> 46:45.586
(Don't you find it cool?)

46:46.264 --> 46:52.080
♪Like a cloud drifting away♪

46:52.632 --> 46:58.160
♪Freely crossing the vast sky♪

46:59.672 --> 47:04.120
♪The world is too quiet♪

47:05.112 --> 47:12.040
♪Amplifying all the sounds♪

47:12.952 --> 47:18.040
♪Who will visit me♪

47:19.096 --> 47:24.720
♪Treading carefully
into my personal space♪

47:25.464 --> 47:28.520
♪Turning the frozen loneliness♪

47:28.760 --> 47:34.080
♪Into concern and care♪

47:39.608 --> 47:44.720
♪Watching stars rise and fall♪

47:45.240 --> 47:51.080
♪Gently pushing me to tour your world♪

47:52.536 --> 47:55.920
♪Swirling into a vortex♪

47:56.056 --> 48:02.280
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

48:02.776 --> 48:05.720
♪The lonely clock♪

48:05.880 --> 48:10.480
♪A relentless pursuit, day and night♪

48:10.872 --> 48:14.120
♪Are we both♪

48:14.392 --> 48:17.920
♪Attracted to each other♪

48:19.064 --> 48:25.680
♪Falling into you♪

48:29.400 --> 48:35.200
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

48:36.056 --> 48:38.720
♪Just a few more embraces away♪

48:39.256 --> 48:43.880
♪From reaching eternity♪

48:44.280 --> 48:47.560
♪After rushing recklessly♪

48:47.768 --> 48:51.200
♪We approach each other♪

48:52.472 --> 48:56.080
♪Without turning back♪

48:57.464 --> 49:05.120
♪In your eyes, I see myself♪

49:05.752 --> 49:12.240
♪Falling into you♪
